        <item>
            <title>3.24.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:56:05 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>223</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.24.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- The "Trust this folder in Claude Code?" prompt added in Claude Code extension 2.1.323 now names the folder it is asking about, along with the extension's explanation. Previously only the title appeared, so there was no way to tell which folder was meant. This also applies when the session runs on another Mac.
]]></description>
